    <section x-show="section===2" class="card"><h2 class="font-semibold">Trigger</h2><div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4"><p class="font-medium">Manual</p><p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">Authorized users start this workflow from its detail page. Future triggers are intentionally hidden.</p></div></section>
